    "source": "ICE"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "The water then ran to the city by gravity, through nearly twenty-six miles of aqueduct.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "caps": [
    "BY *GRAVITY",
    "NEARLY *26 MILES",
    "OF *AQUEDUCT"
